From 9ebee89b031165f221ca06671045d40b7d789bbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simone Primarosa <3505087+simonepri@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:33:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ui, pkg/server: add a flag to open the UI without a default
 query

When the UI opens without a query, it picks a profile type and immediately
queries it across every series in the time range. On a large fleet that first
merge can take minutes or exhaust the server's memory before the user has
chosen what to look at.

--ui-disable-auto-query renders window.DISABLE_AUTO_QUERY into index.html, and
the UI then skips the automatic query, so users pick a profile type and filter
and run the query themselves. The default keeps today's behavior.
